:: Isabel - secret meeting 4 aftermath [bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHTCLUB WC</h1>
<br />

You straightened your clothes in silence. Isabel watched you in the cracked mirror above the sink, something steadier in her face than you'd seen in any of the meetings before this one.

<br /><br />

<center>
	<<image 'people/isabel/meeting4_mirror.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />


<<isabel>>
	Give me a few days to make sure his guards are somewhere else. I'll get word to you when it's time.
<</isabel>>
<br />

<<isabel>>
	After that, there's no going back for either of us. I hope you're ready for that.
<</isabel>>
<br />

